## chart main Skill Registry Audit Map
```mermaid
quadrantChart
  title Skill Registry Audit Map
  x-axis Local manifest issue --> Runtime or cross-repo issue
  y-axis Low adoption impact --> Blocks agent visibility
  "HIGH Visibility break": [0.78, 0.9]
  "MED Placement drift": [0.46, 0.68]
  "OK Registry contract": [0.16, 0.24]
  "Plan First fixes": [0.7, 0.52]
```

## chart visibility-break Visibility Break Detail
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  declared["Required skill or MCP surface is declared"]
  registry["Registry source exists"]
  sbp["SBP effective cwd check"]
  mcp["Claude and Codex MCP parity"]
  blocked["HIGH visibility break"]
  dryrun["Draft narrow dry-run command"]
  verify["Re-run SBP or MCP read-only check"]
  declared --> registry --> sbp --> mcp --> blocked --> dryrun --> verify
```

## chart placement-drift Placement Drift Detail
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  contract["Portable skill contract"]
  runtime["Skillbox runtime and distribution"]
  config["Skillbox config and overlays"]
  current{"Current file owner"}
  public["opensource/skills"]
  skillbox["Skillbox runtime repo"]
  overlay["skillbox-config"]
  contract --> current --> public
  runtime --> current --> skillbox
  config --> current --> overlay
```

## chart registry-contract Registry Contract Detail
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  source["skill-repos.yaml and source manifests"]
  skill["SKILL.md name and description"]
  scope["skill-scope.yaml and SBP policy"]
  bundle["default bundle manifests"]
  mcp[".mcp.json and .codex/config.toml"]
  proof["OK registry contract proof"]
  source --> proof
  skill --> proof
  scope --> proof
  bundle --> proof
  mcp --> proof
```

## chart first-fixes First Fixes
```mermaid
gantt
  title Skill Registry First Fixes
  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat  %m-%d
  section Audit
  Run read-only scanner             :a1, 2026-05-10, 1d
  Confirm active registry evidence  :a2, after a1, 1d
  Run SBP and MCP read-only checks  :a3, after a2, 1d
  section Fix
  Review narrow dry-run commands    :b1, after a3, 1d
  Apply scoped registry fix         :b2, after b1, 1d
  Verify effective visibility       :b3, after b2, 1d
```
